#   improved build of the in-game enemy deck, from his StarCityGames column on Shandalar
#   (article date 2009-06-10).
# archetype: the Shandalar enemy "Cleric" deck, re-tuned within the Shandalar card pool
# designer: Abe Sargent
# year: 2009
